<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Jan-June 97 rubber output up 3.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Jan-June 97 rubber output up 3.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's rubber production rose 3.6 percent year-on-year to 59.7 million kg in the first six months of this year, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that rubber output in the first six months of 1996 was 57.6 million kg.</p>
<p>-- Colombo Newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
